OL,3,GNEWSARunners turn out to highlight
OL,4,Awomen's safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 runners turned out at two
OL,7,Fevents to highlight how many women do
OL,8,Fnot feel safe exercising outside after
OL,9,Fdark.
OL,11,FJersey Spartan Athletic Club's race on
OL,12,FTuesday was part of the Let's Lift the
OL,13,FCurfew national campaign, as was Rock n
OL,14,FRoad Runners on the same evening.
OL,16,FThe annual campaign holds races and
OL,17,Fruns across the UK, aiming to address
OL,18,Fhow more than half of women surveyed do
OL,19,Fnot feel safe running outside in the
OL,20,Fdark.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
