OL,3,GNEWSARunners turn out to highlight
OL,4,Awomen's safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatie Cartwright helped organise the
OL,7,FSpartan club run and said: "I've had a
OL,8,Fvan follow me, hurling abuse at me...
OL,9,FI've had a man push me as I ran along
OL,10,Fthe front, which you just don't expect
OL,11,Fin day-to-day life."
